{"3637720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PLOY", "steam_appid": 3637720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ploy is a rogue-lite turn-based strategy game. You have to reach the last level by destroying and capturing the opponent's creatures and building up a strong team. You can also enhance your pieces by leveling them up to increase their movesets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against different opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/e6626dc8eaf8f0711c9ea8c2e5df5f64.poster.avif?t=1762331258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/e6626dc8eaf8f0711c9ea8c2e5df5f64.webm?t=1762331258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/e6626dc8eaf8f0711c9ea8c2e5df5f64.mp4?t=1762331258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the opponent's creatures and add them to your team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own start formation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/24ace7d6ea883b48c17c96e6ccf8f6cd.poster.avif?t=1762331258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/24ace7d6ea883b48c17c96e6ccf8f6cd.webm?t=1762331258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/24ace7d6ea883b48c17c96e6ccf8f6cd.mp4?t=1762331258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up the creatures and expand their moveset</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/e254fe3a0f111ac12651d9d0abd9aceb.poster.avif?t=1762331258\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/e254fe3a0f111ac12651d9d0abd9aceb.webm?t=1762331258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/e254fe3a0f111ac12651d9d0abd9aceb.mp4?t=1762331258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all 12 creatures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras/f801f66b0e824833bb204a89501317dc.avif?t=1762331258\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637720/extras_big/f801f66b0e824833bb204a89501317dc.webp?t=1762331258 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything except for the audios by me, aka RookGameDev</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Audios - </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tension orchestra chords - frankum <br>Small Adventurers - ShadyDave<br>Ambient Acoustic - StrangerEight<br>Epic trailer action music 2 by humanoide9000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sfx</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number increase - DrMinky <br>Punch - CGEffex <br>Button Click - original_sound <br>Upgrade - colorsCrimsonTears <br>Scene Transition - newlocknew <br>Move Pop Up - Marevnik <br>Piece Move - dave.des <br>Failure And Victory Sound - FunWithSound <br>Capture 